# GeT-RM reference material, Coriell ID NA11839 (CEPH/Utah Pedigree 1349).
# GeT-RM consensus diplotype: *1A/*1B in the older nomenclature this study
# uses -- *1A is the ancestral reference haplotype (this project's *1),
# *1B is the rs2306283-only background variant (this project's *37, per
# PharmVar's later renaming). Translates to *1/*37. Source: Pratt VM et al.
# 2016, J Mol Diagn 18:109-123 (PMID 26621101), as reproduced in Coriell's
# "GeT-RM PGx Search" tool (https://www.coriell.org/GeTRM/PGxSearch,
# retrieved 2026-08-18). Genotype below constructed from this project's own
# dbSNP-confirmed defining-variant coordinates (genes/slco1b1.py), not
# redistributed from GeT-RM/Coriell/CDC directly.
